Package: inectab
Type: Package
Title: Harmonize and Tabulate INEC Ecuador Death and Hospital Discharge Records
Version: 0.3.2
Authors@R: person("Rodrigo", "Henriquez Trujillo", email = "henriquezmd@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3094-4438"))
Description: Reads the INEC (Instituto Nacional de Estadistica y Censos, Ecuador)
    SPSS files of defunciones generales and egresos hospitalarios, 2000-2024,
    applies one crosswalk per year to a standard schema, and caches the result
    as Parquet. Every run logs unmapped and invalid records.
